losed_at":"2025-01-30T10:53:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.4-beta1.\nDoes not affect 4.4-dev7 or prior builds.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon 6700 (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 30.0.15002.1004) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen the editor loads a scene that contains a GPUParticles3D instance with a ShaderMaterial used as the process material, the editor crashes to desktop. This did not occur on previous builds, and does not occur if using a ParticleProcessMaterial as the process material.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a GPUParticles3D instance to a scene.\n2. Add a ParticleProcessMaterial to the process material, save the scene, close and reload. This should work fine, as expected.\n3. Convert the ParticleProcessMaterial to a ShaderMaterial, save the scene, close and reload. This causes a crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nTest project has a default ParticleProcessMaterial assigned to the process material now which allows it to load. Once converted to a shader material however the editor crashes when reloading the scene.\n\n[particletestproject.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18595944/particletestproject.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"tessarakkt","id":118585625,"node_id":"U_kgDOBxF5GQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118585625?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt","html_url":"https://github.com/tessarakkt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tessarakkt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102168/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}